{
  "borough": "Waltham Forest",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;color:#0D0D0D;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its design,\r\nmassing, roof profile and building form would fail to deliver high-quality\r\ndesign and would introduce bulky and an unsympathetic building which would be\r\nout of keeping, and at odds with, the character and scale of the immediate\r\nproperties and the surrounding street scene, to the detriment of the character\r\nof the area. As such the application is not in compliance with Policy 53 and\r\nPolicy 8 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan (2024) or the London Plan,\r\nSupplementary Planning Guidance – Housing (2016), Living with beauty, promoting\r\nhealth, well-being and sustainable Growth, The report of the Building Better,\r\nBuilding Beautiful Commission (Jan 2020) and National Design Guide: Planning\r\npractice guidance for beautiful, enduring and successful places (Jan 2021),\r\ncall upon ensuring high quality developments are forthcoming.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The submitted information which lacks details of existing and proposed window\r\npositioning and room uses of neighbouring development, the proposed development\r\nmay cause significant sense of enclosure and be overbearing to both the\r\nneighbouring occupiers at no.18 and no.20 Mount View Road which is contrary to\r\npolicy 57 of Waltham Forests Local Plan (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
